WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:00.892
Give it a

00:00:00.704 --> 00:00:01.965
model repo get

00:00:01.777 --> 00:00:02.743
a running server

00:00:03.270 --> 00:00:04.166
lmdeck is a

00:00:03.978 --> 00:00:05.546
Rust command-line tool

00:00:05.357 --> 00:00:06.489
and dashboard for

00:00:06.301 --> 00:00:07.916
managing local LLM

00:00:07.728 --> 00:00:08.871
serving recipes

00:00:09.406 --> 00:00:09.948
Give it a

00:00:09.760 --> 00:00:11.021
model repo and

00:00:10.833 --> 00:00:11.622
it detects how

00:00:11.434 --> 00:00:12.118
to run it

00:00:12.307 --> 00:00:13.368
writes the recipe

00:00:13.392 --> 00:00:14.394
and checks whether

00:00:14.206 --> 00:00:14.842
it fits your

00:00:14.654 --> 00:00:15.373
hardware

00:00:15.432 --> 00:00:16.339
from Macs to

00:00:16.151 --> 00:00:17.106
one or more

00:00:16.930 --> 00:00:18.238
DGX Sparks

00:00:18.758 --> 00:00:19.571
Then it pulls

00:00:19.383 --> 00:00:20.078
the weights

00:00:20.185 --> 00:00:21.399
launches the server

00:00:21.529 --> 00:00:22.307
and hands it

00:00:22.119 --> 00:00:22.944
straight to your

00:00:22.767 --> 00:00:23.769
agent harness

00:00:23.900 --> 00:00:25.055
with no manual

00:00:24.867 --> 00:00:26.116
setup in between

00:00:26.646 --> 00:00:27.660
Full story on

00:00:27.471 --> 00:00:28.367
the dashboard
